<!doctype html><html><head><title>fixture</title></head><body><main><p>The Agent API provides a unified interface to models from multiple providers with transparent token-based pricing. Pricing rates are published per model and may differ from provider list prices.</p><h2>OpenAI</h2><table class="m-0 min-w-full w-full max-w-none table [&amp;_th]:text-left [&amp;_td[data-numeric]]:tabular-nums [&amp;_td]:min-w-[150px]"><thead><tr><th>Model</th><th>Input ($/1M)</th><th>Output ($/1M)</th><th>Cache read ($/1M)</th><th>Service tiers</th><th>Docs</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>openai/gpt-6.1-sol</code></td><td data-numeric="true">2.00 (≤272k)<br/>4.00 (&gt;272k)</td><td data-numeric="true">10.00 (≤272k)<br/>15.00 (&gt;272k)</td><td>95% off input</td><td><code>flex</code>, <code>priority</code></td><td><a class="link" href="https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/models/gpt-6.1-sol" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank">GPT-6.1 Sol</a></td></tr><tr><td><code>openai/gpt-6-astra</code></td><td data-numeric="true">10.00 (≤272k)<br/>20.00 (&gt;272k)</td><td data-numeric="true">50.00 (≤272k)<br/>75.00 (&gt;272k)</td><td>90% off input</td><td><code>flex</code>, <code>priority</code></td><td><a class="link" href="https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/models" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank">OpenAI models</a></td></tr><tr><td><code>openai/gpt-6-sol</code></td><td data-numeric="true">2.00 (≤272k)<br/>4.00 (&gt;272k)</td><td data-numeric="true">10.00 (≤272k)<br/>15.00 (&gt;272k)</td><td>90% off input</td><td><code>flex</code>, <code>priority</code></td><td><a class="link" href="https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/models" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank">OpenAI models</a></td></tr><tr><td><code>openai/gpt-6-luna</code></td><td data-numeric="true">0.10 (≤272k)<br/>0.20 (&gt;272k)</td><td data-numeric="true">0.50 (≤272k)<br/>0.75 (&gt;272k)</td><td>90% off input</td><td><code>flex</code>, <code>priority</code></td><td><a class="link" href="https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/models" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank">OpenAI models</a></td></tr><tr><td><code>openai/gpt-5.6-sol</code></td><td data-numeric="true">4.00 (≤272k)<br/>8.00 (&gt;272k)</td><td data-numeric="true">20.00 (≤272k)<br/>30.00 (&gt;272k)</td><td>90% off input</td><td><code>flex</code>, <code>priority</code></td><td><a class="link" href="https://openai.com/index/gpt-5-6/" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank">GPT-5.6</a></td></tr><tr><td><code>openai/gpt-5.6-terra</code></td><td data-numeric="true">2.00 (≤272k)<br/>4.00 (&gt;272k)</td><td data-numeric="true">12.00 (≤272k)<br/>18.00 (&gt;272k)</td><td>90% off input</td><td><code>flex</code>, <code>priority</code></td><td><a class="link" href="https://openai.com/index/gpt-5-6/" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank">GPT-5.6</a></td></tr><tr><td><code>openai/gpt-5.6-luna</code></td><td data-numeric="true">0.20 (≤272k)<br/>0.40 (&gt;272k)</td><td data-numeric="true">1.20 (≤272k)<br/>1.80 (&gt;272k)</td><td>90% off input</td><td><code>flex</code>, <code>priority</code></td><td><a class="link" href="https://openai.com/index/gpt-5-6/" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank">GPT-5.6</a></td></tr><tr><td><code>openai/gpt-5.5</code></td><td data-numeric="true">5.00 (≤272k)<br/>10.00 (&gt;272k)</td><td data-numeric="true">30.00 (≤272k)<br/>45.00 (&gt;272k)</td><td data-numeric="true">0.50</td><td><code>flex</code>, <code>priority</code></td><td><a class="link" href="https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/models/gpt-5.5" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank">GPT-5.5</a></td></tr></tbody></table><h2>xAI</h2><table class="m-0 min-w-full w-full max-w-none table [&amp;_th]:text-left [&amp;_td[data-numeric]]:tabular-nums [&amp;_td]:min-w-[150px]"><thead><tr><th>Model</th><th>Input ($/1M)</th><th>Output ($/1M)</th><th>Cache read ($/1M)</th><th>Service tiers</th><th>Docs</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>xai/grok-4.7</code></td><td data-numeric="true">2.00 (&lt;200k)<br/>4.00 (≥200k)</td><td data-numeric="true">6.00 (&lt;200k)<br/>12.00 (≥200k)</td><td data-nume